  "ruleText": "Env-A 104.47 “Regulated air pollutant” means “regulated air pollutant” as defined in 40 CFR 70.2, reprinted in Appendix D.\n\nSource. #6057-A, eff 6-30-95; renumbered by #8256 (from Env-A 101.225), (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading); renumbered by #8304 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading); renumbered by #9839 (from Env-A 101.158), (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading); ss by #13105, eff 9-25-20 (formerly Env-A 101.160) (see Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-A 100); ss by #14117, eff 11-23-24",
